OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMayor gets #168m to stop rough
OL,4,Asleeping in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayor of London Lord Khan has been
OL,7,Fgiven an extra #168m in government
OL,8,Ffunding to tackle rough sleeping in the
OL,9,Fcapital, including #41m to get people
OL,10,Foff the streets this winter.
OL,12,FThe money will help pay for
OL,13,Faccommodation as well as support to
OL,14,Fhelp rough sleepers into a settled
OL,15,Fhome.
OL,17,FMore than 90% of the funds will be
OL,18,Fhanded to London boroughs and
OL,19,Fhomelessness charities including St
OL,20,FMungo's, Depaul UK, Housing Justice and
OL,21,FCrisis are expected to deliver support.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
