OL,3,GNEWSAMayor gets #168m to stop rough
OL,4,Asleeping in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor is also urging Londoners who
OL,7,Fsee homeless people needing help to
OL,8,Fcontact Streetlink - a national service
OL,9,Fthat connects rough sleepers to support
OL,10,Fprovided by local authorities and
OL,11,Fcharities.
